message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
  Authors are listed by the number of lines they committed, then by the
  number of their commits; equal contributors, if any, are listed
  alphabetically by family name and marked with an asterisk (*) after their
  family names.
title: TESK API
abstract: >-
  TESK API is the API server of TESK, an implementation of the GA4GH Task
  Execution Service (TES) API on Kubernetes: it accepts TES tasks, runs each
  of them as a Kubernetes job of the TESK taskmaster, and reports their
  state and logs from the Kubernetes jobs and pods. It is built with Spring
  Boot and deployed with the Helm chart of TESK.
